Source: pglinter
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pierre-Marie Petit <pmpetit@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
 cargo,
 rustc (>= 1.88),
 libclang-dev,
 libpq-dev,
 pkgconf,
 postgresql-server-dev-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/pmpetit/pglinter
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/pmpetit/pglinter.git
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: postgresql-14-pglinter
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-14, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL database linting and analysis extension
 pglinter analyzes a PostgreSQL database for potential issues, performance
 problems and best practice violations.
 .
 This package contains pglinter for PostgreSQL 14.

